From 407ed206d652d862257836f989e72a067459d19b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 11:38:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add diesel/gasoline futures, refining cracks, and listed-BDC
 price/NAV series

Diesel (HO=F) and RBOB (RB=F) join the daily commodity pull, with derived
crack spreads (product x 42 - Brent) on shared settlement dates. New
fetch_bdc_nav.py builds a basket median of listed BDC price / reported NAV
from SEC XBRL filings with no look-ahead and a staleness cap. Both feed the
daily X-chart research; neither is displayed on the site.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012ZnSbMFaMti2AUNjf9vusu
